# Dockerfile-specific ignore file (BuildKit uses <Dockerfile>.dockerignore next to the Dockerfile).
# Mirrors .gitignore (local caches/build outputs) and keeps common secret-bearing files out of the context.
# None of these patterns matches a file of the released repository.
.git
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.pytest_cache
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
logs/
build/
dist/
**/.env
**/*.env
**/.netrc
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
